          "project/deck.json": {
            "content": "{\n  \"v\": 4,\n  \"createdOnFiles\": {\n    \"v\": 1,\n    \"at\": \"2026-11-05T00:05:05.614Z\"\n  },\n  \"lists\": \"css\",\n  \"title\": \"TCP怎样可靠传输数据（6页讲解）\",\n  \"order\": [\n    \"goal\",\n    \"seq\",\n    \"ack\"\n  ],\n  \"cover\": \"goal\",\n  \"sections\": {\n    \"s1\": {\n      \"description\": \"目标、序号、确认三条主线\",\n      \"start\": \"goal\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"faces\": {},\n  \"style\": [\n    {\n      \"look\": \"slides-builtin/light\",\n      \"colors\": \"background:#f5f4ed surface:#faf9f5 text:#141413 muted:#3d3d3a muted-2:#73726c accent:#d97757 border:#e3dacc inverse:#141413 on-inverse:#faf9f5\",\n      \"fonts\": \"Georgia/serif,/sans\",\n      \"text\": \"display:128,300,1.15,0 h1:112,300,1.2,0 h2:96,300,1.2,0 h3:72,300,1.2,0 lead:44,400,1.4,1 eyebrow:36,500,1.2,1 body:32,400,1.4,1 caption:24,400,1.4,1\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"designSystems\": [\n    {\n      \"namespace\": \"slides-builtin\",\n      \"title\": \"Claude 经典\",\n      \"artifact\": \"https://github.com/JimLiu/baoyu-design/tree/016b39d7fdcc30bfacee31ea5541498ac53921c6/skills/claude-slides\",\n      \"version\": \"016b39d7fdcc30bfacee31ea5541498ac53921c6\",\n      \"copiedAt\": \"2026-11-05T00:05:05.614Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"namespace\": \"baoyu-ember\",\n      \"title\": \"Ember\",\n      \"artifact\": \"https://github.com/JimLiu/baoyu-design/blob/016b39d7fdcc30bfacee31ea5541498ac53921c6/skills/claude-design-system/artifact-type/demo.json\",\n      \"version\": \"016b39d7fdcc30bfacee31ea5541498ac53921c6\",\n      \"copiedAt\": \"2026-11-05T00:05:05.614Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"namespace\": \"baoyu-seazar\",\n      \"title\": \"Seazar\",\n      \"artifact\": \"https://github.com/JimLiu/baoyu-design/blob/016b39d7fdcc30bfacee31ea5541498ac53921c6/skills/claude-design-system/artifact-type/reference/sample-seazar-tokens.json\",\n      \"version\": \"016b39d7fdcc30bfacee31ea5541498ac53921c6\",\n      \"copiedAt\": \"2026-11-05T00:05:05.614Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
            "ifMatch": "05bafcf020533f87c81764d9dbc3f91babf90c1620864cecdb32d559f3c9f7b4"
          },
          "project/slides/ack.html": {
            "content": "<section id=\"ack\" style=\"background:#f5f4ed;color:#141413;font-family:system-ui, sans-serif;padding:128px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:36px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2px;color:#d97757\">第 3 页 · 确认与累计确认</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:80px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.15\">确认号说的是：这个字节我还没收到</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:34px;line-height:1.5;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:24px\"><b style=\"font-weight:700;color:#d97757;min-width:48px\">1</b><span>接收方用确认号告诉发送方：此前的字节都已收到。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:34px;line-height:1.5;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:24px\"><b style=\"font-weight:700;color:#d97757;min-width:48px\">2</b><span>确认号是累计的，一个较大的确认号就覆盖了之前的全部数据。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:34px;line-height:1.5;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:24px\"><b style=\"font-weight:700;color:#d97757;min-width:48px\">3</b><span>乱序到达的段先缓存，等缺口补上，确认号才能往前推。</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#faf9f5;border:1px solid #e3dacc;border-radius:16px;padding:40px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:16px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1;background:#3d3d3a;color:#faf9f5;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:26px\">段 A</span><span style=\"font-size:28px\">1–100</span></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;background:#faf9f5;color:#141413;border:2px dashed #d97757;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:26px\">段 B</span><span style=\"font-size:28px\">101–200 未到</span></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;background:#3d3d3a;color:#faf9f5;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:26px\">段 C</span><span style=\"font-size:28px\">201–300（已缓存）</span></div>\n</div>\n<x-shape kind=\"arrow-up\" style=\"width:56px;height:64px;color:#d97757;align-self:start\"></x-shape>\n<p style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1.4\"><b style=\"font-weight:700\">收到的确认：ACK = 101</b>　→　B 之前都到了，B 一直没到，C 暂存但不能提交给应用。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:64px;font-size:24px;color:#73726c\">3 / 6</p>\n<aside>强调“ACK 101 意思是期待 101 号字节”，与“确认已收到 100 号字节”是同一个意思的两种说法，考试常考。</aside>\n</section>"
          },
          "project/slides/seq.html": {
            "content": "<section id=\"seq\" style=\"background:#faf9f5;color:#141413;font-family:system-ui, sans-serif;padding:128px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:36px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2px;color:#d97757\">第 2 页 · 序号与字节流</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:80px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.15\">序号不是包号，而是字节的位置</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:34px;line-height:1.5;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:24px\"><b style=\"font-weight:700;color:#d97757;min-width:48px\">1</b><span>应用层看到的是一串连续字节，TCP 把它切成段发送。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:34px;line-height:1.5;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:24px\"><b style=\"font-weight:700;color:#d97757;min-width:48px\">2</b><span>每段的序号标的是它携带的第一字节在流中的偏移。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:34px;line-height:1.5;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:24px\"><b style=\"font-weight:700;color:#d97757;min-width:48px\">3</b><span>初始序号由双方在建立连接时各自挑选。</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#f5f4ed;border:1px solid #e3dacc;border-radius:16px;padding:40px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:16px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1;background:#e3dacc;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:700\">段 A</span><span style=\"font-size:28px\">seq = 1，长度 100</span></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;background:#e3dacc;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:700\">段 B</span><span style=\"font-size:28px\">seq = 101，长度 100</span></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;background:#e3dacc;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:700\">段 C</span><span style=\"font-size:28px\">seq = 201，长度 100</span></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:26px;color:#3d3d3a\">字节流总长度 300：1–100 / 101–200 / 201–300</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:64px;font-size:24px;color:#73726c\">2 / 6</p>\n<aside>常见误区：学生以为序号是“第几个包”。用 1、101、201 的示意让他们算下一段的序号，是最好的检验。</aside>\n</section>"
          }
        },
